   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch1/q3",
   "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=z^4-6z^3+pz^2+qz+r\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span> are real constants.</p><p>The roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span> are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\delta\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=3\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta=2+\\mathrm i\"></span></p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span> is a complex root of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>write down the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span>,</li><li>explain why <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\delta\"></span> must be real.</li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\delta\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Hence determine the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Write down the roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(-2z)=0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
